# Official msys2-runtime, pinned to the commit our series is based on; our
# AArch64 changes ride on top as an explicit patch series.  This is the same
# source the msys2-runtime-aarch64* packages build msys-2.0.dll from, so the
# headers this package stages into the sysroot cannot drift from the DLL.
